%% SEITH — Lifecycle Satu Order (money-path detail) — v2
%% REFLECTS Fase B (B1 inline keyboard, B3 push poller, callback transition)
%% Invariant Tier-0: APPROVED/SUBMITTED/FILLED wajib approved_by;
%% trader node tidak percaya status dari wire.
%% Bot push proposal, owner approve via tombol, intake loop submit, nautilus verifikasi.
[*] --> PENDING_APPROVAL: Decision AI membuat proposal (decision_store)

PENDING_APPROVAL --> PROPOSAL_PUSHED: _proposal_poller (45s) push fmt_proposal + tombol ke owner Telegram

PROPOSAL_PUSHED --> APPROVED: 👤 klik ✅tombol approve (callback_query) — approved_by diisi
PROPOSAL_PUSHED --> REJECTED: 👤 klik 🚫tombol reject (callback_query) — approved_by diisi
PROPOSAL_PUSHED --> CANCELLED: /halt manual atau kill-switch / risk reject

APPROVED --> SUBMITTED: intake loop + RiskManager lolos (submit_from_db)
APPROVED --> CANCELLED: RiskManager tolak (risk.evaluate) atau submit gagal

SUBMITTED --> FILLED: venue match (sandbox / live)
SUBMITTED --> CANCELLED: cancel manual, halt, atau risk reject di verify

FILLED --> [*]: PnL tercatat → positions snapshot → dashboard + digest harian

REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of APPROVED
    Invariant keras di schema (OrderProposal):
    APPROVED / SUBMITTED / FILLED wajib punya approved_by —
    transisi ilegal = ValidationError (lihat seith_core.schemas).
    Callback approve melalui _decide() → proposals.approve(rejected=False)
    memaksa invariant sebelum commit DB.
end note

note right of SUBMITTED
    Trader node TIDAK percaya status dari wire —
    verifikasi ulang ke catatan sendiri via nautilus execution reports
    (seith-trading-safety: status field di-rekonstruct, bukan dipercaya).
end note

note left of PENDING_APPROVAL
    Kill switch aktif (ops_flags.is_halted):
    semua submission ditolak, semua proposal terbuka dibatalkan.
    Toggle /resume memakai _guard_owner + inline keyboard off/semi/auto.
end note

note right of PROPOSAL_PUSHED
    Push berasal _proposal_poller — B3 proactive flow.
    callback_data berisi proposal_id (valid <64 byte Telegram limit).
    Race poller↔owner: SQLite busy_timeout(10s) menangani, callback
    refetch proposal sebelum render untuk hindari stale state.
end note
